aether.entity.boss_slider.death_message_8 = [PLAYER] was served on a silver platter to the mighty [BOSS]!

aether.entity.boss_valkyrie=Valkyrie Queen
guidebook.section.mob.valkyrie.queen.name=Valkyrie Queen
guidebook.section.mob.valkyrie.queen.desc=An elegant warrior that can teleport and throw lightning, found in silver dungeons.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.title=%s, The Valkyrie Queen

aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.duel_start = Very well, attack me when you wish to begin.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.condition = Show me 10 victory medals, and I will fight you.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.duel = If you wish to challenge me, strike at any time.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.peacefull = I have no time for pathetic humans like you.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.dies = You are truly... a mighty warrior...
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.weakling = Sorry, I don't fight with weaklings.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.fight_weaklings = Try defeating some weaker valkyries first.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.collect_medals = Collect 10 medallions before trying that.
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.target = This will be your final battle!

aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_0 = [PLAYER] was impressed. [BOSS] was not!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_1 = [PLAYER] fought well. [BOSS] fought weller!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_2 = [PLAYER] knows defeat. [BOSS] has never known defeat!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_3 = [PLAYER] raised a blade. [BOSS] raised victory!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_4 = [PLAYER] felt thunder. [BOSS] is thunder’s voice!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_5 = [PLAYER] was shocked. [BOSS] was amused!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_6 = [PLAYER] lost track. [BOSS] cannot be tracked!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_7 = [PLAYER] offered medals. [BOSS] demanded more!
aether.entity.boss_valkyrie.death_message_8 = [PLAYER] thought themselves worthy. [BOSS] proved them wrong!

aether.entity.boss_sunspirit=Sun Spirit
guidebook.section.mob.sunspirit.name=Sun Spirit
guidebook.section.mob.sunspirit.desc=A devastating burning god that attacks with fire and ice, found in gold dungeons.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat0= You are certainly a brave soul to have entered this chamber.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat1= Begone human, you serve no purpose here.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat2= Your presence annoys me. Do you not fear my burning aura?
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat3= I have nothing to offer you, fool. Leave me at peace.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat4= Perhaps you are ignorant. Do you wish to know who I am?
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat5= I am a sun spirit, embodiment of Aether's eternal daylight.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat5.1= As long as I am alive, the sun will never set on this world.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat6= My body burns with the anger of a thousand beasts.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat6.1= No man, hero, or villain can harm me. You are no exception.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat7= You wish to challenge the might of the sun? You are mad.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat7.1= Do not further insult me or you will feel my wrath.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.chat8= This is your final warning. Leave now, or prepare to burn.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.fight.start= As you wish, your death will be slow and agonizing.
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.fight.repeat= Did your previous death not satisfy your curiosity, human?
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.dies= Such bitter cold... is this the feeling... of pain?

aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_0 = [PLAYER] ignored the sparks dancing around! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_1 = [PLAYER] charged recklessly into my flames! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_2 = [PLAYER] thought they could handle the heat! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_3 = [PLAYER] ran headfirst into danger! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_4 = [PLAYER] ignored my warnings! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_5 = [PLAYER] underestimated the blaze! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_6 = [PLAYER] tried to play with fire! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_7 = [PLAYER] reached for the sun! I, [BOSS], have warned them!
aether.entity.boss_sunspirit.death_message_8 = [PLAYER] got fired! I, [BOSS], have warned them, to file their report on time!

